--ब्रह्मा; comes out of the एकार्णव; the same as what the आरण्यकस् and the उपनिषद्स् say of पुरुषोयज्ञ; being a Vedamaya he introduces १६ R2tviks required for a यज्ञ from the different limbs of a body; मार्कण्डेय came out of his face and saw the world plunged in waters and wondered at it. Once again he entered the body of the Lord, and coming out again he saw a child sleep- ing on a branch of the banyan tree. He got afraid of his loneliness when the baby Lord asked him not to be afraid of him and told him that he was his father and हृषिकेश, etc; con- [page३-741+ ३०] versation between them; then he entered the bowels of the Lord;
1: M. १६७ (whole).
after the stipulated period the Lord thought of the universe and then came वैश्वानर; then a thousand-leafed lotus issued from his navel in the shape of the earth. There appeared ब्रह्मा, the different hills, countries, Mlecchas, etc; from this originated पद्मवीधि in यज्ञस्;
2: Ib. Chh. १६८, १६९.
there also came Madhu and कैटभ, two representatives of the qualities of rajas and tamas who invited the creator for war. Then they sought and got death from विष्णु. ब्रह्मा created a number of mind-born sons as Progenitors of the world.
3: Ib. Chh. १७०, १७१.
